{"4896820": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "We'll Be Fine", "steam_appid": 4896820, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture into mysterious dungeons where fortune favors the bold—but only if they survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with up to <strong>4 players</strong>, choose your unique fantasy class, and explore dangerous medieval ruins filled with monsters, traps, and valuable treasures. The deeper you go, the greater the rewards... and the greater the risks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every expedition is a race against death. Work together, manage your inventory, and decide when it's time to leave. Stay too long, and you might lose everything.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1–4 Player Online Co-op</strong> – Explore dangerous dungeons with friends or face the darkness alone.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose Your Hero</strong> – Play as unique fantasy characters, each with their own playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Risk vs Reward Gameplay</strong> – The more loot you collect, the more you have to lose.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedurally Generated Dungeons</strong> – Every run offers new layouts, challenges, and surprises.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deadly Monsters &amp; Traps</strong> – Stay alert or become another forgotten adventurer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escape With Your Loot</strong> – Surviving is just as important as finding treasure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Medieval Fantasy Setting</strong> – Explore castles, crypts, caves, and ancient ruins filled with secrets.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you push deeper for one more chest... or make it back alive?</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture into mysterious dungeons where fortune 